{"version":1,"content":"<p>曾經歷合約糾紛的25歲日本女星森七菜，近年憑參演賣座電影《國寶》，令演藝事業反彈。</p><p>日前，她與真人片《驀然回首》女星蒔田彩珠現身東京，宣傳兩人合演的串流劇《地雷固力果》。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;當日，森七菜穿下黃色格仔連身</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T15:27:03.255401+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T15:03:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T15:20:18.745777+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T15:20:18.745777+00:00","content_hash":"431ea38b29637ead1e18f9f468511e357e1d1e00219197f97433fa1f1519e97a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}